SUMMARY:Nativity of the Virgin panigiria\, Chroussa and Pagos
LOCATION:Pagos\, Syros\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:On 7-8 September the Catholic villages of the interior celebrate the Nativity of the Virgin: Pagos and Chroussa with a liturgy and a square panigiri with violin\, laouto and local food\, and Lotos and Voulias (Kini) at their own chapels of the Virgin over the following days. Pagos also has a well-known island evening in late July.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/syros/#pagos-nativity-of-the-virgin-panigiria-chroussa-and-pagos
